    "insert": "\nPresenting the limitations of the State of the Art can further justify the need for your research and presents clearly where you want to position your study. While you mention that there have been no concrete studies on this novel role of LLMs in a classroom context, more details on LLMs in a classroom context would have helped painting a more complete picture. If it is difficult to find related work on your exact specific topic, try to broaden your scope to include relevant related work - in this case including different ways LLMs are already included or studies of the learning impact in combination with LLMs."
